<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>How to Play Speedie</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header class="siteHeader">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Speedie</a>
    <nav class="navLinks" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a aria-current="page" href="/instructions">How to play</a>
      <a class="navAction" href="/play">Play</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="rulesScreen">
    <section class="rulesPanel">
      <p class="eyebrow">The rule</p>
      <h1>Click the box that matches the word color.</h1>
      <div class="ruleDemo" aria-label="Example prompt">
        <span class="demoWord">Blue</span>
        <span class="demoArrow">→</span>
        <span class="demoTarget"></span>
      </div>
      <ol class="ruleList">
        <li>Look at the color of the word, not the letters.</li>
        <li>Click the matching colored target in the play zone.</li>
        <li>Finish 20 rounds before the score reaches zero.</li>
        <li>Wrong clicks cost time. Correct clicks add a small bonus.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="button primary" href="/play">Start playing</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>

</html>
